[[File:Crystalised Fear in action.png|thumb|right|Elder casting Crystalised Fear. Note that Shaper was at the back.]]
'''Crystalised Fear''' is a [[debuff]] related to [[The Elder]]'s super siphon skill. The skill is not used in the [[Uber Elder]] fight. The super siphon skill inflicts '''Crystalised Fear''' to players regardless of location, and applies [[Fed Upon]] to enemies in the siphon's cone area of effect.

When inflicted with this debuff, the player is completed immobilised; this is not considered a [[movement speed]] or [[action speed]] slow and cannot be prevented. After a few seconds, [[The Shaper]] will attack the Elder, removing the Crystalised Fear debuff from player.

==Trivia==
The status icon of '''Crystalised Fear''' is called "ElderSuperSiphon.dds" in the game file, while the two debuff icons from the normal Elder's siphon skill [[Sprouting Madness]] and [[Fed Upon]] are called  "ElderSiphon.dds".

